abstract: >-
  The replication package of the dataset Token on Me (TOM), versions 1.0.0 and
  1.1.0: the scripts and the input lists of the selection and of the build, the
  steps after the build, the release passes, the tool pins, the Nix environment,
  the sha256 of each published file, the limitations and the human checks. The
  code is under Apache-2.0; the documents and data files of the authors are under
  CC-BY-4.0 (LICENSE-DATA lists the third-party files and the GPL-3.0-or-later
  copies).
